  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "~Newly Built Home! Professionally designed and decorated!<br><br>Top Reasons to Book Sea Glass: <br>* Private pool (Can be heated during the winter) <br>*Private community beach access<br>*Outdoor shower<br>*Parking for 5 vehicles<br>*Located in the heart of 30A<br>*Newly built with top-of-the-line furnishings<br><br>Welcome to Sea Glass, a stunning, newly built beach home designed for ultimate relaxation and luxury. This breathtaking 6-bedroom, 6.5-bathroom retreat offers everything you need for an unforgettable vacation experience. Located just steps from the pristine shoreline, this property boasts private beach access, allowing you to enjoy the sand and surf right at your doorstep.<br><br>The spacious, open-concept living areas feature top-of-the-line appliances and modern finishes, making it the perfect space for both relaxation and entertainment. The gourmet kitchen is a chef's dream, equipped with the latest technology and sleek countertops, ideal for preparing meals that can be enjoyed in the elegant dining area or al fresco on the expansive deck.<br><br>Each of the six beautifully appointed bedrooms provides a tranquil oasis with ample space and luxurious touches, including en-suite bathrooms. The 6.5 bathrooms are designed with spa-like features, offering a perfect escape after a day at the beach.<br>Take advantage of the private pool for a refreshing swim or rinse off in the outdoor shower after a day of sun and sand. For evening relaxation, unwind at the wet bar with a refreshing cocktail, enjoying the serene surroundings.<br><br>Whether you're relaxing by the pool, stepping directly onto the beach, or hosting an intimate gathering, this beach home provides everything you need to create lasting memories. Book your stay today and experience a coastal getaway like no other.<br><br>1st Floor:<br>Bedroom #1: King Bedroom- Primary bedroom w/ ensuite bathroom<br>Half Bathroom<br><br>2nd Floor:<br>Bedroom #2: King Bedroom w/ ensuite bathroom<br>Bedroom #3: King Bedroom w/ ensuite bathroom<br>Bedroom #4: 2 Queen Beds w/ ensuite bathroom <br><br>3rd Floor:<br>Bedroom #5: Bunkroom w/ two Twin over Full bunks<br>Bedroom #6: 2 Queen Beds w/ a Full Bathroom<br><br>Pool heater available for a fee November - April( Based on outside Temperature) <br>7 Night minimum during peak seasons. Saturday to Saturday",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "30A Luxury Home w/ Private Pool! Sleeps 20! - SeaGlass"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
